OL,3,GNEWSAPeople living near M4 say junction
OL,4,Aclosure plan will 'make traffic worse'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living close to the M4 have said
OL,7,Fplans to closure junctions on the
OL,8,Fmotorway would "make traffic worse" in
OL,9,FNewport.
OL,11,FThe Welsh government announced a
OL,12,Fproposal on Tuesday to completely close
OL,13,Fjunction 27 at High Cross and close the
OL,14,Feastbound slip roads at junction 26 in
OL,15,FMalpas and junction 25 in Caerleon to
OL,16,Ftackle bottleneck congestion at the
OL,17,FBrynglas Tunnels.
OL,19,FBut those living in the city stressed
OL,20,Fit would have a "massive impact" on
OL,21,Ftheir commute and they would have to go
OL,22,Fout of their way to get home.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
