OL,3,GNEWSAPeople living near M4 say junction
OL,4,Aclosure plan will 'make traffic worse'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDimitri Batrouni, the city council
OL,7,Fleader, has vowed to fight the
OL,8,Fproposals, saying residents should not
OL,9,Fhave to pay the price for attempts to
OL,10,Fease congestion.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
